**Pilot objective:** Progress begins with joy – Helping athletes grow by making fun, team spirit, and well-being open for discussion.\
**Target group:** All types of athletes from age 12 and up.\
**Pilot duration:** Minimum 6 months.\
**Web application access:** [https://sport-meter.nl/](https://sport-meter.nl/)

Great to have you here! The Check-in Meter was specially developed for coaches and supervisors who want to care for their team – not only physically, but also mentally. With SportMeter, you can easily check in with your athletes and quickly gain insight into how they are *really* doing. This way, you can give low-threshold attention to mental resilience, joy, and togetherness.

{% Video src="@/assets/works/mentale-kracht/infographic.mp4" /%}

### Why this module?

Mental health in sports often remains underexposed. Yet research shows that many athletes *and* coaches struggle with psychological issues, while sports can actually be such a powerful driver for well-being and development.

But: 91% of sports clubs have *no* offerings focused on mental health, and only 4% have policies for it. That can and must change. With the Check-in Meter, we want to change this together.

### How does it work?

Each week, athletes fill in a short check-in – sometimes about fun, sometimes about motivation, recovery, or team spirit. The results appear in a clear overview for coaches and supervisors. It is a tool that strengthens team meetings and one-on-one conversations and makes fun and well-being measurable at three levels:

1. For the athlete – awareness, ownership, and a voice in the team.

2. For the coach/supervisor – concrete starting points for conversations and guidance.

3. For the board – insight into well-being policy and the check-in culture within the club.

### Together for Impact

The power of the Check-in Meter lies in its simplicity: short measurements of no more than two minutes, linked to the game schedule or rest days. Automatic reminders make it almost effortless.

By working together – athletes, coaches, and the board – we build a sports climate in which everyone feels seen and joy forms the basis for growth and performance. That is the impact we stand for.

👉 Sign up for a free demo and discover how the Check-in Meter can make a difference at your club.

